#EXTINF:-1 tvg-id="demo.movies.sintel" tvg-name="PrimeTV Demo Film" group-title="Cinéma" tvg-language="English" tvg-category="Movies" tvg-quality="1080p",PrimeTV Demo Film — Sintel
https://commondatastorage.googleapis.com/gtv-videos-bucket/sample/Sintel.mp4

